Package: capitalbe
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: double-entry personal finance manager for V\OS
 CapitalBe tracks money across accounts, payees, categories and scheduled
 transactions in account registers, with budgets, reconciliation, QIF
 import/export, multi-currency support and reports (net worth, cash flow,
 transaction and budget reports).
